## 5. Results — routed lane (Iteration 2)

### 5.1 Funnel

| Category | Count | % |
|---|---:|---:|
| Total golden linkages | 1,229 | 100% |
| Linkages missed (no risk text) | 0 | 0% |
| Final linkages by solution (addressable) | 1,229 | 100% |
| Not judged (upstream RSM gap) | 131 | 10.7% |
| Judged insufficient | 0 | 0% |
| Judged not linked | 845 | 68.8% |
| **Caught (validated)** | **253** | **20.6%** |
| Discoveries | 165 | |

### 5.2 The waterfall — 1,229 down to 272

| Stage | Removed | Remaining |
|---|---:|---:|
| Golden links as handed | | 1,229 |
| less data gap (no risk text) | 0 | 1,229 |
| less never judged (upstream gap) | 131 | 1,098 |
| less structural over-mapping | 707 | 391 |
| less correct rejection | 119 | 272 |
| less SME-only | 0 | 272 |
| **= text-derivable truth** | | **272** |
| of which **validated** | | **253** |
| of which **fixable miss** | | **19** |

Closes exactly: 1,229 − 131 − 707 − 119 = 272 = 253 + 19.

**Text-derivable recall = 253 / 272 = 93.0%**

### 5.3 How the 1,098 becomes 272

| Stage | Count | Counts toward the 93%? |
|---|---:|---|
| 1 · Judged | 1,098 | denominator of the 23% figure |
| 2a · Model said LINKED | 253 | YES — numerator |
| 2b · Model said NOT LINKED → sent to audit | 845 | split below |
| 3a · Audit: structural over-mapping | 707 | NO — removed |
| 3b · Audit: correct rejection | 119 | NO — removed |
| 3c · Audit: SME judgement required | 0 | SME only |
| 3d · Audit: true link missed | 19 | YES — a real miss |
| 4 · **Corrected denominator** | **272** | denominator of the 93% |

**Narration:** of the 1,098 links we ruled on we made 253; of the 845 we did not make, an independent audit says 826 were never real links — the golden had swept them in wholesale; strip those out and we were judged against 272 genuine links, of which we found 253.

### 5.4 Confusion matrix (2,409 judged pairs)

| | Golden linked | Golden not linked | Total |
|---|---:|---:|---:|
| Model LINKED | 253 | 165 | 418 |
| Model NOT LINKED | 845 | 1,146 | 1,991 |
| **Total** | **1,098** | **1,311** | **2,409** |

TN is **contaminated** — it also holds real links nobody has recorded yet.

### 5.5 Prompt iteration

Between prompt versions nothing changed but the prompt. Caught links moved **134 → 253** on identical data.

What changed:
- Removed the business-line veto
- Taught the model that horizontal / cross-cutting risks (regulatory change, governance, record-keeping) link broadly
- Mapped obligations to legal entities by regulated role
- Treated placeholder taxonomy values (`TBD`, blank) as missing data rather than a mismatch

